  "title": "Nourishing Russian Peas Pilaf",
  "description": "A comforting and flavorful Russian dish featuring frozen peas and ferment-jang, perfect for a weeknight dinner. This shojin-friendly recipe is mustardy and fluffy, making it a great option for a nourishing meal.",
