  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the grated carrot and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Add the mustard seeds and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the thawed peas, ferment-jang, salt, and pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the brown rice to the saucepan and stir to combine with the pea mixture.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes, stirring constantly, until the rice is heated through.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
